Subject: [PATCH] Add MTK porting patches: libxlog shim, ifc_utils MTK extras,
 adbd enabled
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

These changes have been in the working tree all along and are part of every
successful build (both userdebug 40dbdb5b01 and user rebuild, both
field-tested OK):
- libxlog: __xlog_buf_printf shim routing to __android_log_vprint
- libnetutils/ifc_utils + ifc.h: MTK extras (allmc, throttle, fwmark,
  ccmni_md_cfg, reset_connection_by_uid)
- init.h: ENV[32] -> ENV[64]
- libcutils: disable surfaceflinger file-cap entry (breaks LD_SHIM_LIBS)
- init.usb.rc: keep adbd enabled

